SegmentEveryForam was created from Segmenteverygrain commit
1ab65ccdfa3fcd4ab567a3528c2a2b06758c8653 (2026-08-14). Files carried over
from Segmenteverygrain have since been modified; the main changes are:

  - the Python package was renamed from `segmenteverygrain` to
    `segmenteveryforam`, and the interactive `GrainPlot` interface was renamed
    `ForamPlot` (with `GrainPlot` kept as an alias);
  - U-Net checkpoints were fine-tuned for foraminifera, replacing the
    general-grain checkpoints;
  - foraminifera morphometrics, specimen export, SAM 2.1 box prompting, a
    Google Colab workflow and a Gradio browser prototype were added;
  - upstream example datasets, the general-grain checkpoints and the
    Segmenteverygrain JOSS paper sources were removed.

The full modification history is available in the Git history of
https://github.com/Geogabriel/SegmentEveryForam.

The original `interactions` module was written by Dave Matthews for
Segmenteverygrain.

SegmentEveryForam uses SAM 2.1 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/sam2),
developed by Meta. SAM 2.1 model checkpoints are not included in or
redistributed by this repository and are subject to their own license terms.
